WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.588
Nobody will ever experience a problem sounds reassuring, but the fictional brief cannot support that promise.

00:00:06.588 --> 00:00:10.705
Replace it with a specific action, owner and honest limit.

00:00:10.705 --> 00:00:13.587
The service reviewer checks each fictional draft.

00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:19.352
Participants can correct or reject it and put a question in the practice log.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:23.057
The service manager reviews questions before any next decision.

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:27.998
This is a defined review arrangement, not a guarantee of perfect results.

00:00:27.998 --> 00:00:32.116
Now remove the pressure of adopt immediately or fall behind.

00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:39.115
Explain the bounded purpose instead: one week to examine first-summary help and correction effort using fictional cases.

00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:44.468
Name the editable example and the human question route supplied in this case.

00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:46.526
Keep a wider rollout undecided.

00:00:46.526 --> 00:00:51.879
In your own message, verify that each promised action has an authorized owner.
